# ---------- Your narration scripts ----------
# Your own scripts stay local; only the example is committed.
# (Deliberately limited to scripts/ so requirements.txt is still tracked.)
# To version a script of your own, add a line like: !scripts/my-demo.txt
scripts/*.txt
!scripts/narration.example.txt
